          "text": "Timing: each October through December, and staff turnover across MLB clusters in the weeks after clubs are eliminated. Early October 2026 is inside this window for the Cubs.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/5",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
