          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Value at stake (hypothesis): coaching salaries are small compared with player payroll, so a good evaluation could have high leverage per dollar if true coach effects exist.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/8",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Simple baseline a club already uses: hire by reputation, playing career, network referrals, interviews, and the outcomes of the coach's prior team.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/9",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Mechanism of advantage: public team and staff directories, media transaction reports and Baseball-Reference coaching records can be joined to player-level public metrics. This builds a coach-player linkage panel.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/10",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Mechanism of advantage: use movement-based identification. Track the same players under different coaches, and the same coaches with different players. This separates coach effects from player aging and talent.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/11",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Mechanism of advantage: the model would estimate within-player changes after a coaching change, compared against matched players whose coaches did not change. It would use public outcome metrics such as chase rate, zone contact, pitch-mix shifts and walk rate.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/12",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Software intervention: a coach-candidate dossier generator. For each candidate it would report the before/after trajectories of players they coached, with uncertainty intervals, matched controls and sample-size warnings.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/13",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Software intervention: a retrospective test. Freeze data as of each past offseason, rank the coaching hires made that winter, and check whether the rankings predicted the next one to two seasons of player-change metrics better than the prior-team-outcome baseline.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/14",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Unconventional extension: treat staff as a scarce market. Flag undervalued coaches whose players improved but whose teams lost, since a team-record baseline would systematically overlook them.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/15",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Coach effects on player outcomes are large enough and persistent enough to detect above noise. This is the central challenge, and the result may well be a null.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/16",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Public staff assignment data is complete and accurately dated enough to build a linkage panel. Mid-season title changes and shared roles may blur attribution.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/17",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Player improvement after a coaching change is not dominated by confounders that public data cannot separate. Examples include regression to the mean, front-office technology, private biomechanics programs, and the same front office hiring both the player and the coach.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/18",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Hitting and pitching coaches control enough of player development to deserve credit. Many clubs spread instruction across analysts, coordinators and private trainers, so attribution may be meaningless.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/19",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The number of coach moves per year gives enough independent events for a retrospective test. Small N could make any ranking statistically indistinguishable from the reputation baseline.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/20",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Clubs that already analyze coaches internally with private data are likely ahead of a public-data model. Software may then add little beyond organizing candidate research.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/21",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Interpersonal fit, communication and clubhouse trust may dominate a coach's value and resist public measurement. A quantitative dossier might mislead more than it informs if over-weighted.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/22",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Software may be unnecessary if the binding constraint is candidate availability or salary competition rather than evaluation quality.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/23",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Minor-league staff effects might be more detectable than MLB effects because the player samples are larger. However, public minor-league tracking data may be too thin or too recent to support this.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4/claim/24",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/4",
