          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The 25th and 26th players get enough playing time in a series to matter. Postseason managers may concentrate innings on the top 8 to 10 pitchers regardless of roster choice.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/5/claim/9",
