          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Contending clubs, including the Cubs, already run private versions of this simulation, so a public tool may only match current practice.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/5/claim/10",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/5",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Retrospective validation will suffer from very small samples, since each club plays few postseason series per decade. League-wide pooling is needed, and it removes club-specific context such as health.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/5/claim/11",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/5",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
