      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/baseline/0/2",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Waiver-claim and DFA monitoring. Owner: front office. Decision: continuous during the season and offseason, decide whether to claim or trade for designated-for-assignment players. Value at stake: small per player, but recurring and cheap. Mechanism: rank DFA'd players by public projections relative to the Cubs' roster depth. Baseline: manual scouting review of the transaction wire. Software: an automated alert scoring each DFA'd player against current roster needs.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
