      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/baseline/0/2/claim/44",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/baseline/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "This likely resembles the R001 low-ceiling result, with a \"played in MLB\" rule capturing most of the value, so it should be deprioritized unless a backtest shows otherwise.",
