      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=non-tender and tender decisions; owner=GM; decision=tender or non-tender arbitration-eligible players at the late-November or early-December deadline; value at stake=projected arbitration salary versus the cost of replacing the player on the open market; mechanism=pair projected arbitration salaries with a forecast of comparable non-tendered and free-agent replacements available that winter at known prices; baseline=tender if projected WAR per dollar beats a club threshold; intervention=a replacement-market forecaster backtested on which past non-tendered players signed, at what price and with what next-season output.",
