      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=the trade-deadline buy, sell or hold posture; owner=president of baseball operations; decision=posture and the price of rentals in late July; value at stake=prospect capital spent versus a change in playoff probability; mechanism=translate marginal WAR into change in playoff and series-win probability under the current playoff format, using public projection systems, and price acquisitions per point of playoff odds; baseline=a judgment of standings position plus playoff-odds websites; intervention=a marginal playoff-value calculator backtested on public deadline trades.",
