      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=places where software is likely unnecessary or clubs and vendors are already ahead; owner=business operations; decision=dynamic ticket pricing, concessions demand forecasting and lineup batting order; value at stake=real for ticketing, small for batting order; mechanism=none clearly available to a new public-data tool, since ticketing vendors already run dynamic pricing and batting-order gains are known to be small; baseline=existing vendor platforms and conventional lineup heuristics; intervention=deprioritize these.",
