      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=a rules-transition scenario engine; owner=president of baseball operations; decision=contract structures, arbitration and draft strategy across an expected collective bargaining transition, at a one-time but high-stakes moment this offseason; value at stake=multiple contract and roster decisions made under rule uncertainty; mechanism=simulate outcomes under several plausible rule scenarios so commitments made now are robust to rule changes; baseline=wait for the new agreement or rely on legal staff judgment; intervention=a scenario model that reprices extensions, qualifying offers and pool strategy under each rule set.",
