      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Pinch-hitting and defensive substitution timing; owner: manager; decision: when to use a bench bat or defensive replacement in late innings, made daily; value at stake: win probability added in high-leverage situations; mechanism: compare the leverage-weighted value of using a bench player now against keeping him for a likely later spot; baseline: platoon-advantage substitutions plus routine late-inning defensive swaps; software: an in-game bench-usage model, backtested on public play-by-play by replaying substitution decisions.",
