      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=coaching-staff hiring is decided by reputation and interviews rather than evidence of player improvement; owner=President of Baseball Operations, GM and manager; decision=hiring or retaining MLB and upper-minors hitting, pitching and catching coaches each October to December, with this offseason's window open now; value at stake=hypothesized as large and recurring because one coach touches many players' outcomes for several seasons, size unknown; mechanism=build a public coach-tenure ledger from press releases and media guides, then estimate each coach's effect on players who changed organizations, comparing the year before arrival with the year after and against matched players who did not move; baseline=network referrals, reputation from players, and interview impressions; software=a coach-attribution tool that ranks candidates with uncertainty intervals and flags coaches whose apparent effect is just regression to the mean.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/2",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Public records of coach tenure, including assistant and minor-league roles, are complete and dated accurately enough to link coaches to players.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/3",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Coach effects can be separated from organizational infrastructure, playing time, park, injury and selection effects, given that teams acquire players they already expect to improve.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/4",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Sample sizes per coach are large enough that intervals are not too wide to change a hiring decision; this is a major challenge, because most coaches touch few players.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/5",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "A retrospective test is possible by asking whether coach ratings built on seasons up to year T predict player changes under the same coach in year T+1 better than a reputation proxy such as prior big-league coaching tenure.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/6",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Clubs may already do this privately, so the edge could be zero; this cannot be verified from public information.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/7",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
