      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=pricing players posted from NPB and KBO and signed internationally as free agents; owner=GM, international scouting director and pro scouting director; decision=whether to bid on posted players and how much, during posting windows that usually run November to January; value at stake=potentially large per signing, since these are multi-year major-league contracts, but the number of events per year is small; mechanism=translation models that use public foreign-league stats, including pitch-tracking where it is published, along with age and league-environment adjustments, calibrated on the MLB outcomes of previously posted players; baseline=scouting reports combined with simple ratios of foreign-league stats to MLB stats and agent-driven market comparables; software=a probabilistic translation tool with explicit uncertainty that is updated as each new posting cohort produces MLB results.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/12",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Enough historical posted players with MLB outcomes exist to calibrate a model that beats simple ratios; the small number of cases is the main threat.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/13",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Public foreign-league data at decision time is detailed enough, and changes in league environment, such as the ball or rules, can be adjusted for.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/14",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Market prices for posted players are set by bidding among several clubs, so any edge in accuracy must also overcome the winner's curse.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/2/claim/15",
