      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Clubs already use internal spring tracking at a much finer grain, so a public-data edge may be small or zero.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-211812-efe1740f0c77/candidates/0/3/claim/4",
