      "text": "Problem=coaching-staff hiring evaluation; owner=president of baseball operations and GM; decision=filling hitting, pitching and bench coach vacancies, typically in October and November; value=staff influence on many players at once, though hard to isolate; mechanism=public player-level changes before and after a coach's arrival at prior stops, adjusted for aging and regression, could separate coaches with repeatable effects from those who benefited from roster churn; baseline=reputation, interviews and network referrals; intervention=a coach-attribution model on public staff histories and player performance deltas.",
